      462.48
     ],
     "text": "stability of the population."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "score": 0.949,
   "signal": "pp-doclayoutv3",
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "This variety arises from controlled pollination\nbetween the botanical varieties var. sp/endida and\nvar. sericea followed by selection in random\ncrossing F2 and F3 generations for conformity to the\nvar. Splendida phenotype and for maximal seed\nproduction. Final selections were subjected to 2\nfurther generations seed production to improve the\nstability of the population.",
